{"text":"purananuru","n":281,"lines":["தீங்கனி இரவமொடு வேம்புமனைச் செரீஇ","வாங்குமருப்பு யாழொடு பல்இயம் கறங்கக்","கைபயப் பெயர்த்து மைஇழுது இழுகி","ஐயவி சிதறி ஆம்பல் ஊதி","இசைமணி எறிந்து காஞ்சி பாடி","நெடுநகர் வரைப்பின் கடிநறை புகைஇக்","காக்கம் வம்மோ காதலந் தோழீ","வேந்துறு விழுமம் தாங்கிய","பூம்பொறிக் கழற்கால் நெடுந்தகை புண்ணே"],"tr":["tīṅkaṉi iravamoṭu vēmpumaṉaic cerīi","vāṅkumaruppu yāḻoṭu paliyam kaṟaṅkak","kaipayap peyarttu maiiḻutu iḻuki","aiyavi citaṟi āmpal ūti","icaimaṇi eṟintu kāñci pāṭi","neṭunakar varaippiṉ kaṭinaṟai pukaiik","kākkam vammō kātalan tōḻī","vēntuṟu viḻumam tāṅkiya","pūmpoṟik kaḻaṟkāl neṭuntakai puṇṇē"],"colophon":{"tinai":"kāñci","tinai_ta":"காஞ்சி","turai_ta":"பேய்க் காஞ்சி","poet_ta":"அரிசில் கிழார்","poet_tr":"Aricil Kiḻār"},"scan":{"meter":"nēricai āciriyappā","ok":true,"checks":[{"name":"lines","ok":true,"detail":"9 lines"},{"name":"feet per line","ok":true,"detail":"8×4, 1×3 feet"},{"name":"foot types","ok":true,"detail":"iyaṟcīr 33, veṇcīr 2"},{"name":"linkage","ok":true,"detail":"āciriyattaḷai 24, veṇṭaḷai 8, kalittaḷai 2"},{"name":"ending","ok":true,"detail":"ends on ஏ"}],"ending":"ஏ","lines":[[{"text":"தீங்கனி","tr":"tīṅkaṉi","foot":"kūviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"தீங்","tr":"tīṅ"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"கனி","tr":"kaṉi"}]},{"text":"யிரவமொ","tr":"yiravamo","foot":"karuviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"யிர","tr":"yira"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"வமொ","tr":"vamo"}]},{"text":"டுவேம்புமனைச்","tr":"ṭuvēmpumaṉaic","foot":"karuviḷaṅkāy","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"டுவேம்","tr":"ṭuvēm"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"பும","tr":"puma"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"னைச்","tr":"ṉaic"}]},{"text":"செரீஇ","tr":"cerīi","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"செரீ","tr":"cerī"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"இ","tr":"i"}]}],[{"text":"வாங்குமருப்","tr":"vāṅkumarup","foot":"kūviḷaṅkāy","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"வாங்","tr":"vāṅ"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"கும","tr":"kuma"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"ருப்","tr":"rup"}]},{"text":"புயாழொடு","tr":"puyāḻoṭu